	)
	(text "Two limits: the eFuse ceiling set by ILM (2.04 A, 1.04 A, ±7.5 %), and the firmware budget from the INA226 below it (EN dropped on overrun).\nOvercurrent is limited, not flagged: FLT goes low on thermal shutdown only, then the eFuse retries on its own.\n3V3_OUT comes on with SHIELD_PRESENT_N (ID EEPROM), 5V_OUT after a valid descriptor. Enables pulled low: off in reset and bootloader."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "28a6d60f-01e3-5791-a8b5-009a374c97c5")
	)
